、电吉他、贝斯、鼓、弦乐器、大提琴、长笛\n电子乐器：合成器、节奏器、音场、鼓机、808贝斯、失真音效\n音质：温暖的、模拟的、低音质的、混响浓郁的、干净的混音、现场录制的\n\nVocal：\n性别 / 音域：Male Tenor, Female Alto, Children’s Vocals, Choir\n声线 / 技巧：Breathy, raspy, smooth, powerful, belting, vibrato, ad-libs, harmonies\n风格：Soulful, Pop-punk, Folk, Rap, Spoken Word\n男高音、女高音、儿童声乐、合唱团\n轻柔的、沙哑的、流畅的、有力的、高音嘶吼的、颤音、即兴演唱、和声\n深情的、朋克风格的、民谣的、说唱的、朗诵式的音乐风格"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [556.5347290039062, 672.7888793945312], "pos": [-83.71658325195312, 941.5105590820312], "id": 18, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [682.0224899942073, -917.8940588962378], "scale": 0.8769226950000014}}, "groups": [{"color": "#8AA", "font_size": 60, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "SUNO V5", "bounding": [-94.15476989746094, 180.06260681152344, 2021.818115234375, 664.2179565429688]}], "links": [[1, 3, 0, 5, 0, "AUDIO"], [2, 6, 0, 3, 0, "STRING"], [4, 7, 0, 3, 1, "STRING"], [6, 3, 4, 10, 0, "STRING"], [7, 3, 4, 11, 0, "*"], [10, 3, 1, 15, 0, "AUDIO"], [11, 3, 0, 14, 0, "AUDIO"]], "id": "970ff3c3-bb9f-429c-bb5e-311c74db14b9", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 18, "revision": 0}